nyarwanda audio. English, French and Swahili subtitles on every title.\n        </p>\n<address class=\"mt-5 space-y-1.5 text-[13px] not-italic leading-relaxed text-white/50\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3\">\n<p data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3-1\">KG 7 Ave, Kigali</p>\n<p data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3-2\"><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3-2-1\" href=\"tel:+250788621000\">+250 788 621 000</a></p>\n<p data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3-3\"><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-3-3-1\" href=\"mailto:hello@princefilms.rw\">hello@princefilms.rw</a></p>\n</address>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-1-2\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-white/70\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-1\">Browse</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-1\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Movies</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-2\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Series</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-3\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Interpreters</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-4\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Search</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-5\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">My List</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-1-3\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-white/70\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-1\">Categories</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-1\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Action</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-2\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Drama</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-3\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Comedy</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-4\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Thriller</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-5\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Crime</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-1-4\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-white/70\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-1\">Account</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-1\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Log in</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-2\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Create an account</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-3\"><a class=\"text-white/50 transition hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-4-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">My List</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.08] pt-6 text-[13px] text-white/50 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"5-1-2\">\n<p data-kid=\"5-1-2-1\">© 2026 PRINCEFILMS. All rights reserved.</p>\n<p class=\"num\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2\">30 titles <span class=\"text-white/20\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-1\">/</span> 10 interpreters</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n",
